flowchart TD
 U[User / Browser] --> UI[Streamlit UI: Library, Create, History]
 UI --> GS[Gemini API: captioning, image editing, embeddings]
 UI --> S[Python service layer]
 S --> DB[(SQLite: image + version metadata)]
 S --> FS[(Local image files: uploads + versions)]
 S --> VS[(JSON vector store: caption embeddings)]
 UI --> R[Semantic retrieval: query embedding + cosine similarity]
 R --> VS
 R --> UI
